	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  après une mise à jour Windows10, le serveur postgre ne démarre pas]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=28887#p28887"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>J&#039;ai oublié de vous donner le message d&#039;erreur :<br />could not connect to server: Connection refused (0x0000274D/10061) Is the server running on host &quot;localhost&quot; (::1) and accepting TCP/IP connections on port 5432? could not connect to server: Connection refused (0x0000274D/10061) Is the server running on host &quot;localhost&quot; (127.0.0.1) and accepting TCP/IP connections on port 5432?</p>]]></content>
